%% MEDGUARD — Diagram 7: Sequence — upload, analysis and review in local mode (src/lib/services.ts)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Reviewer
    participant UI as React UI
    participant S as services.ts
    participant X as extract.ts / browserOcr.ts
    participant E as statements.ts + detect.ts
    participant DB as IndexedDB (Dexie)
    R->>UI: Drop file into case
    UI->>S: uploadDocument(file, metadata)
    S->>S: validate extension, MIME, magic bytes, size, SHA-256 duplicate
    S->>DB: store original blob + 'uploaded' event
    S->>X: extract text (pdf.js → OCR if page has < 20 chars → mammoth)
    X-->>S: text, page spans, OCR confidence, low-confidence word spans
    S->>E: extractStatements(text)
    E-->>S: statements with charStart/charEnd
    S->>DB: documents + statements + 'extracted' event
    R->>UI: Click "Analyze documents"
    UI->>S: analyzeCase(caseId)
    S->>E: detectContradictions(case statements, case documents)
    E->>E: group by concept · compare polarity/values/units/dates · verifyStatement()
    E-->>S: draft findings + comparison stats
    S->>DB: reconcile by fingerprint (keep review state, mark stale) + events
    R->>UI: Open finding, choose decision + reason
    UI->>S: transitionFinding(id, to, reason)
    S->>S: validateTransition() (state machine, reason ≥ 5 chars)
    S->>DB: update status + append event
